<title>JAPAN: Shinagawa Refract -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinagawa Refract -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.04		vs	   24.68</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.20		vs   loss 876    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 91    million	  vs   loss 422    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 121    million	  vs     prft 4.30</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.84 yen	  vs    prft 65.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     66 million	  vs	  66 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinagawa Refractories Co Ltd produces refractories for steel makers.</p>
</text>
